     "set": null,
     "content": "\u201c\u0643\u0627\u0646\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0635\u0641\u062d\u0629 \u0645\u0631\u0628\u0643\u0629 \u062c\u062f\u064b\u0627 \u0648\u0644\u0645 \u0623\u062c\u062f \u0632\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0641\u0639\u201d<br><i>\u2014 P4 \u00b7 03:12</i>"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 428.0,
     "y": 472.051,
     "width": 138.109,
     "height": 89.968,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": null,
     "content": "\u201c\u99c5\u306e\u5238\u58f2\u6a5f\u3067\u5f80\u5fa9\u3092\u9078\u3093\u3060\u3064\u3082\u308a\u304c\u7247\u9053\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\ud842\udfb7\u201d<br><i>\u2014 P5 \u00b7 1:02:03</i>"
    },
    {
     "kind": "header",
     "x": 856.0,
     "y": 148.0,
     "width": 300.0,
     "height": 195.429,
     "colour": "light_pink",
     "set": null,
     "content": "<strong>Trust</strong><br>3 quotes"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 856.0,
     "y": 367.429,
     "width": 103.407,
     "height": 67.362,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": null,
     "content": "\u201cIs this site even safe?\u201d<br><i>\u2014 P1 \u00b7 10:00</i>"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 856.0,
     "y": 458.791,
     "width": 185.448,
     "height": 120.806,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": 1,
     "content": "\u201cI put my card details in and then it just sat there, spinning, for what felt like a minute. I didn&#x27;t know if I&#x27;d paid\u2026"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 861.0,
     "y": 553.456,
     "width": 261.159,
     "height": 170.126,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": 1,
     "content": "\u2026I didn&#x27;t want to press the button again in case it charged me twice, so I went and checked my banking app. Nothing there either. In the end I closed the tab and rang them, and the person on the phone said it happens a lot.\u201d<br><i>\u2014 P2 \u00b7 14:05 \u00b7 <a href=\"https://clips.example/study/s2-p2-845.mp4\">\u25b6 clip</a></i>"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 856.0,
     "y": 747.582,
     "width": 236.172,
     "height": 153.849,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": 2,
     "content": "\u201cWe always do the big shop on a Sunday, the three of us, and the list lives on the fridge until somebody takes a photo of it. So when the app asked me to build a list I thought, great, finally\u2026"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 861.0,
     "y": 869.508,
     "width": 236.172,
     "height": 153.849,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": 2,
     "content": "\u2026But it wanted me to search for every single item, one at a time, and it kept suggesting brands we never buy. By the time I had twelve things in there my son had lost interest and wandered off\u2026"
    },
    {
     "kind": "quote",
     "x": 866.0,
     "y": 991.433,
     "width": 293.466,
     "height": 191.172,
     "colour": "light_yellow",
     "set": 2,
     "content": "\u2026Then it said two of them were out of stock at our store and offered substitutes that were twice the price. I just wanted it to remember what we bought last week. That&#x27;s all. Last week&#x27;s list, with a tick box next to each thing, and I&#x27;d have been done in two minutes instead of twenty.\u201d<br><i>\u2014 P6 \u00b7 21:50</i>"
    }
   ]
